nput 不存在或非目录类型 → kubelet 挂载 hostPath 卷校验失败 → 容器无法启动 (ContainerCreating) → Pod 持续处于未就绪状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 的挂载卷 `input` 在宿主机节点 `node2` 上无法被正确识别。具体表现为 Kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时检测到路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 的类型校验失败（非目录或不存在）。此故障直接导致应用容器无法启动并持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n**未知项**：该路径在宿主机上不存在的确切原因（是宿主机环境初始化失败、路径配置错误还是文件权限问题），当前工具未采集到宿主机侧的文件系统状态事实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 55.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 13.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 29.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 29.8s (Evidence 23.3s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 55.939, "metrics": {"run_id": "84f82bc2034d4f70", "mttr": {"value": "55.9s", "seconds": 55.94426345825195, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（